{"page":331,"verses":[{"verse_key":"21:102","surah":21,"ayah":102,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يَسْمَعُونَ حَسِيسَهَا ۖ وَهُمْ فِى مَا ٱشْتَهَتْ أَنفُسُهُمْ خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they will not hear a murmur from it- and endlessly they will enjoy everything their souls desire.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْمَعُونَ","en_gloss":"they will hear","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":3,"ar":"حَسِيسَهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"(the) slightest sound of it","transliteration":"ḥasīsahā","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱشْتَهَتْ","en_gloss":"desire","transliteration":"ish'tahat","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنفُسُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their souls","transliteration":"anfusuhum","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_gloss":"will abide forever","transliteration":"khālidūna","verse_key":"21:102"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٠٢","en_gloss":"(102)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:102"}]},{"verse_key":"21:103","surah":21,"ayah":103,"ar_uthmani":"لَا يَحْزُنُهُمُ ٱلْفَزَعُ ٱلْأَكْبَرُ وَتَتَلَقَّىٰهُمُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ هَـٰذَا يَوْمُكُمُ ٱلَّذِى كُنتُمْ تُوعَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They will have no fear of the great Terror: the angels will receive them with the words, ‘This is the Day you were promised!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَحْزُنُهُمُ","en_gloss":"will grieve them","transliteration":"yaḥzunuhumu","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْفَزَعُ","en_gloss":"the terror","transliteration":"l-fazaʿu","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْأَكْبَرُ","en_gloss":"[the] greatest","transliteration":"l-akbaru","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَتَتَلَقَّىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"and will meet them","transliteration":"watatalaqqāhumu","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en_gloss":"the Angels","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"This","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَوْمُكُمُ","en_gloss":"(is) your Day","transliteration":"yawmukumu","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كُنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"kuntum","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تُوعَدُونَ","en_gloss":"promised","transliteration":"tūʿadūna","verse_key":"21:103"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٠٣","en_gloss":"(103)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:103"}]},{"verse_key":"21:104","surah":21,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"يَوْمَ نَطْوِى ٱلسَّمَآءَ كَطَىِّ ٱلسِّجِلِّ لِلْكُتُبِ ۚ كَمَا بَدَأْنَآ أَوَّلَ خَلْقٍ نُّعِيدُهُۥ ۚ وَعْدًا عَلَيْنَآ ۚ إِنَّا كُنَّا فَـٰعِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"On that Day, We shall roll up the skies as a writer rolls up [his] scrolls. We shall reproduce creation just as We produced it the first time: this is Our binding promise. We shall certainly do all these things.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(The) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَطْوِى","en_gloss":"We will fold","transliteration":"naṭwī","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءَ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāa","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَطَىِّ","en_gloss":"like (the) folding","transliteration":"kaṭayyi","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسِّجِلِّ","en_gloss":"(of) a scroll","transliteration":"l-sijili","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِلْكُتُبِ ۚ","en_gloss":"for records","transliteration":"lil'kutubi","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"As","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَدَأْنَآ","en_gloss":"We began","transliteration":"badanā","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَوَّلَ","en_gloss":"(the) first","transliteration":"awwala","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَلْقٍۢ","en_gloss":"creation","transliteration":"khalqin","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُّعِيدُهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"We will repeat it","transliteration":"nuʿīduhu","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَعْدًا","en_gloss":"a promise","transliteration":"waʿdan","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَلَيْنَآ ۚ","en_gloss":"upon Us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We ","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":15,"ar":"كُنَّا","en_gloss":"We are","transliteration":"kunnā","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَـٰعِلِينَ","en_gloss":"(the) Doers","transliteration":"fāʿilīna","verse_key":"21:104"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٠٤","en_gloss":"(104)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:104"}]},{"verse_key":"21:105","surah":21,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ كَتَبْنَا فِى ٱلزَّبُورِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ٱلذِّكْرِ أَنَّ ٱلْأَرْضَ يَرِثُهَا عِبَادِىَ ٱلصَّـٰلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We wrote in the Psalms, as We did in [earlier] Scripture: ‘My righteous servants will inherit the earth.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And verily","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَتَبْنَا","en_gloss":"We have written","transliteration":"katabnā","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلزَّبُورِ","en_gloss":"the Scripture","transliteration":"l-zabūri","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرِ","en_gloss":"the mention","transliteration":"l-dhik'ri","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"the earth ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَرِثُهَا","en_gloss":"will inherit it","transliteration":"yarithuhā","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عِبَادِىَ","en_gloss":"My slaves","transliteration":"ʿibādiya","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحُونَ","en_gloss":"the righteous","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥūna","verse_key":"21:105"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٠٥","en_gloss":"(105)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:105"}]},{"verse_key":"21:106","surah":21,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ فِى هَـٰذَا لَبَلَـٰغًا لِّقَوْمٍ عَـٰبِدِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There truly is a message in this for the servants of God!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"21:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"21:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"this","transliteration":"hādhā","verse_key":"21:106"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَبَلَـٰغًۭا","en_gloss":"surely is a Message","transliteration":"labalāghan","verse_key":"21:106"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّقَوْمٍ","en_gloss":"for a people","transliteration":"liqawmin","verse_key":"21:106"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَـٰبِدِينَ","en_gloss":"worshippers","transliteration":"ʿābidīna","verse_key":"21:106"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٠٦","en_gloss":"(106)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:106"}]},{"verse_key":"21:107","surah":21,"ayah":107,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَآ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ إِلَّا رَحْمَةً لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was only as a mercy that We sent you [Prophet] to all people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"21:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"We have sent you","transliteration":"arsalnāka","verse_key":"21:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"21:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رَحْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(as) a mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatan","verse_key":"21:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِّلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","en_gloss":"for the worlds","transliteration":"lil'ʿālamīna","verse_key":"21:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"١٠٧","en_gloss":"(107)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:107"}]},{"verse_key":"21:108","surah":21,"ayah":108,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ إِنَّمَا يُوحَىٰٓ إِلَىَّ أَنَّمَآ إِلَـٰهُكُمْ إِلَـٰهٌ وَٰحِدٌ ۖ فَهَلْ أَنتُم مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say, ‘What is revealed to me is that your God is one God- will you submit to Him?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُوحَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"it is revealed","transliteration":"yūḥā","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَىَّ","en_gloss":"to me","transliteration":"ilayya","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنَّمَآ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"annamā","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَـٰهُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your god","transliteration":"ilāhukum","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) God","transliteration":"ilāhun","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٰحِدٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"One","transliteration":"wāḥidun","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"so will","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَنتُم","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"antum","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّسْلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"submit (to Him)","transliteration":"mus'limūna","verse_key":"21:108"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٠٨","en_gloss":"(108)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"21:108"}]},{"verse_key":"21:109","surah":21,"ayah":109,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَقُلْ ءَاذَنتُكُمْ عَلَىٰ سَوَآءٍ ۖ وَإِنْ أَدْرِىٓ أَقَرِيبٌ أَم بَعِيدٌ مَّا تُوعَدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But if they turn away, say, ‘I have proclaimed the message fairly to you all. I do not know whether the judgement you are promised is near or far,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ف